  destinations:
  - destinationName: Snow Path
    description: 'Fresh snow blankets the mountain trails in sparkling white.

      Every
      step leaves footprints through the peaceful winter landscape.

      Hidden
      rewards await beyond the frosty hills.

      Adventure shines beneath every
      snowflake.'
    background: {fileID: 1373247513634287043, guid: f1148a0cc61a4476f87a94d17419509c, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Frozen Lake
    description: 'A crystal-clear lake lies frozen beneath the winter sky.

      Glittering
      ice reflects the surrounding snowy mountains.

      Explore carefully across
      the frozen surface.

      Every step uncovers another magical surprise.'
    background: {fileID: -1883502208402434403, guid: e4eeb4e9ec9c44175bcc399f8359326f, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Ice Cave
    description: 'Brilliant blue ice forms breathtaking caves beneath the mountains.

      Frozen
      walls sparkle like precious crystals in the light.

      Hidden chambers hold
      exciting discoveries.

      Every corner glows with frozen wonder.'
    background: {fileID: -1244620754844294941, guid: 0c49e23be26f84c9f95fed183d12b0d9, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Aurora Ridge
    description: 'Colorful northern lights dance gracefully across the night sky.

      Snow-covered
      peaks glow beneath the magical display.

      Journey through icy trails filled
      with breathtaking scenery.

      The heavens themselves light your path.'
    background: {fileID: 2124795794252985129, guid: 00cc4ea0bbe404cf0a34f843f4130a19, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Glacier Peak
    description: 'Towering glaciers dominate the highest mountain summit.

      Powerful
      winds shape the frozen landscape year after year.

      Hidden routes lead
      toward unforgettable views.

      Only the bravest explorers reach the top.'
    background: {fileID: -6259213831603604300, guid: e81babefea3a5419da4c7b700ca3771e, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Ice Palace
    description: 'A magnificent palace carved entirely from shimmering ice awaits.

      Frozen
      halls sparkle like diamonds beneath soft blue light.

      Every room hides
      another magical discovery.

      A royal winter adventure begins here.'
    background: {fileID: 3327244263770038927, guid: 4049b18800dd94336b3fa989dbf4b964, type: 3}
